X: 1
T: What Wondrous Love Is This?
C: Words: Anonymous before 1811.  
C: Music: 'Wondrous Love' American Folk Tune.  Setting: Rufus Henry Cornelius, 1916, alt.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music source: "Songs of the Cross", 1924 Hymn 208
S: Lyrics source: "The Choice: in two parts; Part I, containing Psalms and hymns, Part II, containing spiritual songs; designed for public and private worship" (6th ed.) (1856), p.348 Hymn 40
S: setting alterations/key change by Brian Dumont, 11 March 2026 and released into the public domain
M: 4/4 % time signature
L: 1/4 % default length
